{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738820/extras/55fdb1f0be851956ec6a8fabf0439cfa.avif?t=1758048638\" width=300 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nonogram Nonsense</i>] is a pure logic puzzle game for players who crave challenge without clutter. Solve procedurally generated nonogram puzzles \u2014 number-based logic grids that reveal abstract patterns, not images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Puzzle of the Day</strong> and <strong>Endless\u00a0 Generation</strong>, there\u2019s always something new to solve. Clean, minimal design keeps the focus where it belongs: on the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Puzzle of the Day \u2013 A new random puzzle seeded daily</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e\ufe0f Unlimited Puzzles \u2013 Generate and solve endlessly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Smart Generation \u2013 Always solvable with logic, never guesswork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Accessible Design \u2013 Straightforward interface with no clutter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe Mid-Game Save \u2013 Pause and resume puzzles anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Optional Timer \u2013 For those who enjoy racing the clock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Focused Game-play \u2013 Minimal menus, no ads, no micro-transactions</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the Party, Bub","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3738820/ca16cacb81c182272c0b29d5636a2497dd726306.jpg"},{"name":"Back Off, Man! I'm a Scientist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3738820/511677267cb83c56937805f435774bb48a5b8352.jpg"},{"name":"Hasta la Vista, Baby","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3738820/708baa937057e6c6e1eede93cd150223563d607d.jpg"},{"name":"Yippee-ki-yay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3738820/0b925b14abd8ab2541779687e36ad45d3a866138.jpg"},{"name":"I Feel the Need for Speed ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3738820/e187eafe669304d1958c3dd253df9fadb7a84362.jpg"},{"name":"Engage!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3738820/edcbf5903f5e28c9dbc86416977821ea423e5c08.jpg"},{"name":"I Could Do This All Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3738820/3c05b1641dd789bb645b080376316fca4ce269b8.jpg"},{"name":"Just When I Thought I Was Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3738820/fe996f08e6ad301f631279f783b355cb8810e39c.jpg"},{"name":"Nobody Puts Baby in a Corner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3738820/63f5efba427f45821ed20795051a2df672dabc08.jpg"},{"name":"Life Moves Pretty Fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3738820/355fc34c8c135014099ed94b3469ddbf8622b7be.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738820?t=1758048638","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738820/6d27a245c35da246570d8a478e1e950e5abbd615/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758048638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738820/09eeb8ab50967d59af1d7238420d5de462c2adab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758048638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738820/09eeb8ab50967d59af1d7238420d5de462c2adab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758048638","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id